# Hardware validation (P-9) — real cameras, real NVRs. None of this exists yet.
#
# ⚠️ Every camera-facing stage below is NOT IMPLEMENTED and will report as such. L-1 stands: no
# Hikvision, Dahua, CP Plus, UNV or Axis device has ever been connected to this platform, and this
# profile exists so that fact is stated by a run rather than remembered by a person.
# `requires` accepts stage ids, or the token `always` — which means "run even if the run
# aborted". Only the report uses it: an aborted night is the one that most needs a written summary.

preflight | Pre-flight checks               | platform/preflight.sh   | RUN_PREFLIGHT |           | abort    | TIMEOUT_PREFLIGHT
# ⭐ The one stage on this profile that IS implemented (P-9 A8). It runs the whole certification
# procedure against the synthetic fixture in the deployed runtime image, and asserts the verdict is
# still a REFUSAL. Registered here rather than on `nightly` because this is the hardware profile's
# subject, and because the certification soak lands beside it the day real devices arrive.
certification | Certification procedure, end to end | hardware/certification.sh | RUN_CERTIFICATION | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_RUNTIME
onvif     | ONVIF discovery against devices | hardware/onvif.sh          | RUN_ONVIF     | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_RUNTIME
vendors   | One camera per vendor family    | hardware/cameras.sh | RUN_VENDORS | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_RUNTIME
nvr       | Four-channel NVR ingest         | hardware/nvr.sh   | RUN_NVR       | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_RUNTIME
h265      | H.265 decode path               | hardware/h265.sh  | RUN_H265      | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_RUNTIME
stability | Stability run on real streams   | runtime/stability.sh    | RUN_SOAK      | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_SOAK
benchmark | Capacity ladder on real streams | runtime/benchmark.sh    | RUN_BENCHMARK | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_BENCHMARK
# ⚠️ On real hardware the question is which cameras a box can actually take, and that is a
# placement decision before it is a throughput one.
assignment           | Camera assignment, end to end | assignment/assignment.sh | RUN_ASSIGNMENT | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_ASSIGNMENT
assignment-benchmark | Assignment capacity ladder    | assignment/benchmark.sh  | RUN_ASSIGNMENT_BENCHMARK | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_ASSIGNMENT_BENCHMARK
loitering            | Retail loitering, end to end  | loitering/loitering.sh      | RUN_LOITERING      | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_LOITERING
rule-replay          | Rule replay determinism       | events/rule-replay.sh       | RUN_RULE_REPLAY    | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_RULE_REPLAY
rule-benchmark       | Loitering capacity ladder     | loitering/rule-benchmark.sh | RUN_RULE_BENCHMARK | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_RULE_BENCHMARK
report    | Morning summary                 | platform/report.sh      | RUN_REPORT    | always   | continue | TIMEOUT_REPORT
